WEBVTT

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.000
Love your Stock Tokens…

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:03.920
but want more flexibility?

00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:05.070
With Turret, you can

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:07.830
borrow USDG without selling them!

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:09.430
Pick a token you hold,

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:11.550
like Apple, Nvidia, or Tesla.

00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:13.440
Choose how much to deposit,

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:15.120
and how much you want to borrow.

00:00:15.230 --> 00:00:16.390
Review your loan,

00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:18.200
then confirm in your wallet.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:20.720
Your Stock Token backs the loan.

00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:21.860
You get USDG to use,

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:23.400
while keeping exposure

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:24.980
to your token’s price.

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:27.400
Ready to get your tokens back?

00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:29.140
Repay what you owe,

00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:30.520
and withdraw them.

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:33.100
That’s borrowing with Turret.
